<title>UK: Granada, YTTV talks likely in next 2 weeks.</title>
<headline>Granada, YTTV talks likely in next 2 weeks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Executives from Yorkshire-Tyne Tees Television and Granada Group Plc are set to meet in the next fortnight to discuss a possible bid by Granada for its northern neighbour.</p>
<p>&quot;Within the next week or two we will sit down to talk business,&quot; said a Yorkshire spokesman. Granada will publish its interim results on Wednesday and it appears clear that a deal will not emerge in time to twin it with that announcement.</p>
</text>
